OL,3,GNEWSATour showcases world's first
OL,4,Aindustrial worker homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors are being given the chance to
OL,7,Fpeek inside one of the world's first
OL,8,Fever homes for industrial workers -
OL,9,Fbuilt 250 years ago for staff from a
OL,10,Fwater-powered cotton spinning mill in
OL,11,FDerbyshire.
OL,13,FThe cottages in North Street, Cromford,
OL,14,Fwere commissioned by Sir Richard
OL,15,FArkwright, recognised as one of the
OL,16,Ffounders of the industrial revolution.
OL,18,FTo mark the anniversary, visitors will
OL,19,Fbe able to explore one of the houses
OL,20,Facross two open days on Saturday and
OL,21,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
