OL,3,GNEWSATour showcases world's first
OL,4,Aindustrial worker homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTour co-ordinator George Greaves said
OL,7,Fthe open days will be a "rare
OL,8,Fopportunity to actually get in and
OL,9,Fexplore" the life of a mill worker in
OL,10,Fthe 1770s.
